  "description": "A beautiful, self-contained Quartz.NET scheduler dashboard. Drop into any ASP.NET Core app with two lines of code. View jobs, triggers, history, execution graph, timeline, health, and control the scheduler from a polished SPA. Includes SignalR real-time updates and an embeddable read-only mode.",
